{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46882","headline":"荆州新秋寺居写怀诗五首上南平王 四 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋寺居写怀诗五首上南平王 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉江西岸蜀江东，六稔安禅教化中。\n托迹幸将王粲别，归心宁与子山同。\n尊罍岂识曹参酒，宾客还亲宋玉风。\n又见去年三五夕，一轮寒魄破烟空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}